    "title": "Diego Luna scores two to send the USMNT to Gold Cup Final. Here's how to buy his jersey: - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Diego Luna is killing it on the international stage for the U.S. Men's National Team. He scored both goals in the semifinal game against Honduras that sent the USMNT to the Gold Cup Final . And get this—he's only 21 years old. Luna is currently playing for the USMNT , but he also plays for Real Salt Lake in Major League Soccer, where he's known as the 'Moon man.' Earlier this year, he received awards as Utah's Pro Male Athlete of the Year and the 2024 MLS Young Player of the Year. Here's how to rep Diego Luna's jersey ahead of Team USA's finals appearance: Get this navy blue and striped jersey created by Nike for the USMNT. $134.99 at World Soccer Shop He's moonlighting on the USMNT during the CONCACAF Gold Cup, but Diego Luna plays full time for the Real Salt Lake. $194.99 at Fanatics Get this red version of Real Salt Lake's jersey kit. $194.99 at Fanatics The U.S. will face Mexico in the CONCACAF Gold Cup final on Sunday, July 6 at 7 p.m. ET at NRG Stadium in Houston, Texas. This article originally appeared on USA TODAY: Diego Luna scores two to send the USMNT to Gold Cup Final. Here's how to buy his jersey:",
